cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "GARA: Gap-Aware Representation Alignment for Wylie-to-Classical-Chinese Translation"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for GARA, a parameter-efficient fine-tuning method that pairs
  LoRA with a lightweight embedding-side Alignment Adapter and a gap-aware
  dynamic weighting term, applied to translating Tibetan Wylie romanisation
  into Classical Chinese.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tibet University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/JackXfmax/GARA"
url: "https://github.com/JackXfmax/GARA"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - parameter-efficient fine-tuning
  - LoRA
  - representation alignment
  - Tibetan
  - Wylie transliteration
  - Classical Chinese
  - machine translation
preferred-citation:
